type=\"page\" data-updated-on=\"1567159367674\" id=\"page-5ccc7d92aa8bde0001647d81\">\n<div class=\"row sqs-row\">\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-10\">\n\n\n<P style=\"padding:5px\">\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Proxima Nova', Georgia, sans-serif;\"><strong>Looking for an alternative night out in London?</strong> </h2>\nThen look no further, Roller Disco at London’s only purpose built nightclub on wheels provides fun filled events for all the family!<br><br>\nRoller Nation hold a range of events and sessions for everyone to enjoy including a Family Jam skating session and a range of quirky club nights over the course of the weekend.  Complete with a line-up of the hottest DJ’s, a licensed indoor bar, tasty diner serving hot food all over the weekend and a great outdoor seating area to chill with your friends. \n<br><br>\nTickets for Roller Nations Club Nights are available online and are at high demand, it is recommended to book your tickets to ensure entry on the night. \n\n</P>\n\n<P style=\"padding:5px\">\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Proxima Nova', Georgia, sans-serif;\"><strong>\nWant to make your night in London even more special? </strong> </h2>\nThe opportunity to book and reserve a booth is now available online! Book now to secure your perfect, one stop, night out on wheels. \n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both; height:32px\"></div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-10\">\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n   <img src=\"/images/DJ.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%;\" >\n</div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n     <img src=\"/images/roller+bar.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%;\" >\n</div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n     <img src=\"/images/group-photo.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%;\" >\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"clear:both; height:2px\"></div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\" spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-10\">\n\n\n<P style=\"padding:5px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Proxima Nova', Georgia, sans-serif;\">\n<strong>London’s eclectic nightlife scene attracts not only the local area skaters, but also visitors from across the globe.  </strong> </h2>\nThe Tottenham area of London is, and always has been, well known for its history of entertainment and “the place to be seen” for a night out in London. Over the decades large groups of people would visit the world renowned gardens in this area for music, company and refreshments, Roller Nation continues this trend with visitors from across the world coming to the Tottenham based venue to enjoy a night out on wheels. \n<br><br>Join us with your group of friends and enjoy access to our Indoor Licensed Bar and Diner, outdoor seating area and full on disco, DJ and roller skating fun.\n<br><br>Roller Nation, The Home of The Roller Disco’s venue has transport links across the city of London. With easy access to the London underground transport lines and a 24/7 local bus route that runs throughout the city. \n\n</P>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-10\">\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n   <a href=\"https://tfl.gov.uk/maps/bus\" target=\"blank\"><img src=\"/images/Buses.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%;\" ></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n     <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Roller+Nation/@51.5948716,-0.0705533,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0xe306383078729c8a!8m2!3d51.5948716!4d-0.0705533\" target=\"blank\"><img src=\"/images/Map.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%;\" ></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-3\">\n     <a href=\" https://tfl.gov.uk/maps/track/tube\" target=\"blank\"><img src=\"/images/underground.jpg\" alt=\"Roller Nation \" style=\" max-width: 95%; height: 275px;\" ></a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"clear:both; height:12px\"></div>\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\">\n<div class=\" spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1\" data-block-type=\"21\" id=\"block-8e88d056e6fa8a1bb802\">\n<div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col sqs-col-10\">\n\n\n<P style=\"padding:5px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Proxima Nova', Georgia, sans-serif;\">\n<strong>No one parties quite like Roller Nation! Roller Disco is ideal for a unique night out clubbing with friends to funky and classic tunes by some of London’s best DJ’s. </strong> </h2>\nLook Out for Roller Nations limited events that are held for one month only and are partnered with trending DJ’s and Groovy Tunes. London nights out have never been so exciting!\n</P>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>    \n\n</section>  </main>\n\n   \n</div>\n \n</div>\n  <footer class=\"Footer\" role=\"contentinfo\" data-controller=\"FooterBreakpoints\" data-controllers-bound=\"FooterBreakpoints\">\n\n<div class=\"Footer-inner clear\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12 Footer-blocks Footer-blocks--top sqs-alternate-